{
 "A bus-ticket agent in Addis Ababa collects traces and complaints every day. On their own, they change nothing.": "5c38dcb45c.mp3",
 "A wrong fare becomes an evaluation. A stale timetable goes to the context source. Each signal goes to the layer that owns the cause.": "cb083d88f9.mp3",
 "Give each fix a named owner and a proof that it held. Now the pawl catches, and the wheel can't slip back.": "17a8db4c3f.mp3",
 "An unapproved refund becomes a policy. A retry storm belongs to the runtime, not to a longer prompt.": "5d7edbdb27.mp3",
 "A year of rules, none removed. Every change now drags them all along, and people start routing around them.": "69a668d9a4.mp3",
 "So each control states when it can go. The system keeps what it learned, and the pile stays small.": "ab496b2e67.mp3"
